# Helm value coalescing edge cases for the new PDB template (reviewer probe)

== --set-json controller.podDisruptionBudget={}  (map present, enabled missing)
PDB rendered: 1

== --set controller.podDisruptionBudget=null  (explicit opt-out)
PDB rendered: 0

== --set controller.podDisruptionBudget.enabled=false
PDB rendered: 0

Interpretation: {} keeps the chart default (coalesce preserves enabled: true) — sensible; null/false opt out.
